// title: Sentinel Timeroasting KQL detection
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: CommonSecurityLog, DeviceNetworkEvents
// purpose: Sentinel Timeroasting KQL detection
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Sentinel%20Timeroasting%20KQL%20detection.kql
// kind: repo
// author: Steven Lim
